  "based_on": "d1a3d4c171fb2551a0ac90fd6dcb45605b2ea8fc0e4352d12eca4f63ee1d8a93",
  "prompt": "Cho hình hộp đứng <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>D</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mi>A</mi><mi>′</mi></msup><msup><mi>B</mi><mi>′</mi></msup><msup><mi>C</mi><mi>′</mi></msup><msup><mi>D</mi><mi>′</mi></msup></mrow></semantics></math> có đáy là hình thoi. Cho biết <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>B</mi><mi>D</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>,</mo><msup><mi>A</mi><mi>′</mi></msup><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi></mrow></semantics></math>.\n\t<ol class=\"alpha-list\"><li>Tính độ dài <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>′</mi></mrow></semantics></math>.</li><li>Tính tổng diện tích các mặt của hình hộp.</li></ol>",
  "choices": [],
  "correct": null,
  "solution": "<div class=\"with-figure\"><div><ol class=\"alpha-list\"><li>Ta có <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">{</mo><mtable><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"/><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left\"><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>D</mi><mrow><mspace width=\"0.333em\"/><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\"> (</mtext></mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>D</mi><mrow><mspace width=\"0.333em\"/><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\"> là hình thoi) </mtext><mspace width=\"0.333em\"/></mrow></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"/><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left\"><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>B</mi><mi>D</mi><mrow><mspace width=\"0.333em\"/><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\"> (gt)</mtext></mrow></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow><mo>⇒</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>D</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>B</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Suy ra <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>△</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow></semantics></math> đều. \n\t\t\t\tGọi <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>O</mi></semantics></math> là trung điểm <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow></semantics></math>, thì<br><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>O</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>⇒</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>A</mi><mi>O</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Do <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>D</mi><mi>.</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>′</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>′</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>′</mi><mi>D</mi><mi>′</mi></mrow></semantics></math> là hình hộp đứng nên <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>′</mi><mo>⊥</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow></semantics></math>. <br><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>△</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>′</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow></semantics></math> vuông tại <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>A</mi></semantics></math>, suy ra <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>′</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>′</mi><msup><mi>C</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mi>A</mi><msup><mi>C</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msqrt><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mrow><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow></semantics></math>.</li><li>Ta có <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi>B</mi><mi>D</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>⋅</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>a</mi><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Vì <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>D</mi><mi>.</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>′</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>′</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>′</mi><mi>D</mi><mi>′</mi></mrow></semantics></math> là hình hộp đứng nên các mặt bên của nó là hình chữ nhật. Hơn nữa, ta có cạnh của các hình chữ nhật này đều bằng <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>a</mi></semantics></math>, nên các mặt bên của hình hộp là bốn hình vuông cạnh <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>a</mi></semantics></math>.<br>Như vậy, tổng diện tích các mặt của hình hộp là\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"math-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mtable><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"><mi>T</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><msub><mi>S</mi><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>′</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>′</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mi>S</mi><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mrow><mspace width=\"0.333em\"/><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\"> (đvdt). </mtext><mspace width=\"0.333em\"/></mrow></mtd></mtr></mtable></semantics></math></div></li></ol></div><div class=\"side-figure\"><figure class=\"tex-figure\"><img src=\"/bank-assets/6fda2139c063346654400e5dcf375663a9124c4cc4eed5353ff134b17f7377c9.svg\" alt=\"Hình minh họa\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"figure-zoom\" aria-hidden=\"true\">⤢</span></figure></div></div>",
